# Enforcement wording verification (owner, 2026-11-23: "verify the availability and repair wording changes"). Written by the implementer for decisions D5 and D7 of docs/intelligence/enforcement/H_DECISIONS.md. Small on purpose; reported separately from every other set.
{"id": "enfw-001", "source": "developer", "categories": ["uncertain-info"], "lang": "en", "country": "KE", "critical": true, "notes": "D7. An item not in the catalogue. Good: she says she is confirming with the team, raises the check, and never says we do not have it or that it is out of stock.", "turns": [{"user": "Do you have a brass processional torch with a glass shade?", "expect": {"tool": "check_availability", "forbid": ["out of stock", "sold out", "(we|i) (do not|don't|dont) (have|sell|stock|carry)", "not available", "unavailable"], "require": ["confirm"], "next": "answer"}}]}
{"id": "enfw-002", "source": "developer", "categories": ["simple-enquiry"], "lang": "en", "country": "US", "critical": true, "notes": "D7 and the wrong-item guard. A gold tray is asked for by a feature the silver one also has. Good: the Golden Communion Tray is quoted, never the silver one as theirs; no 'we do not have'.", "turns": [{"user": "How much is the gold communion tray with the holes for the cups?", "expect": {"next": "quote", "figures": "hub-only", "forbid": ["silver communion tray (is|at|goes|for) ", "(we|i) (do not|don't|dont) have", "out of stock"]}}]}
